    "body": "Problem\n\nThe Codeium/Windsurf chat feature does not work in Neovim. The extension reports:\n\nConnection Error\n\nMissing chat language server URL.\nPlease ensure that you are signed in to the Codeium plugin and close / reopen the chat window.\nIf the problem persists, please restart the IDE.\n\nThe diagnostics indicate that authentication and the local service appear to be working, but the chat server URL is never provided.\n\nRelevant diagnostics:\n\nconnection.status = CONNECTED\nhealth.checkStatus = 200\nisChatEnabled = true\nready = true\nbridge.bridgeType = null",
